  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(48 ÷ 72 × 3) – [15 ÷ 8 × (40 – 32) – 10] + 2P = 6 ÷ 2\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/47485e25d1b30c57dc271863db8b99be0c8e209069b2596cc885911d898a8a78.png] \n\n**Calculation**\n\n(48 ÷ 72 × 3) – [15 ÷ 8 × (40 – 32) – 10] + 2P = 6 ÷ 2\n\n⇒ (48 ÷ 72 × 3) – [15 ÷ 8 × (8) – 10] + 2P = 3\n\n⇒ (48 ÷ 72 × 3) – [15 × 1 – 10] + 2P = 3\n\n⇒ (48 ÷ 72 × 3) – [15 – 10] + 2P = 3\n\n⇒ (2/3 × 3) – [5] + 2P = 3\n\n⇒ (2) – [5] + 2P = 3\n\n⇒ -3 + 2P = 3\n\n⇒ 2P = 6\n\n⇒ P = 3\n\n**∴ Option 1 is the correct answer.**",
